  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Extension Training Transforming Economic Returns</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase food security, incomes and resilience of smallholder farmers in Malawi_x000d_
1- Strengthen agricultural extension services through farmer field school groups in order to secure effective and productive services for smallholder farmers._x000d_
2- Increase the absorptive/anticipatory, adaptive and transformative capacities of smallholder farmers to adapt to adverse effects of climate change and improve food security._x000d_
3- Improve food security for farmers through effective livelihood diversification and technology transfer.</narrative>
  </description>
